# G125 — Traffic Light Application

*v2. See `traffic-light.md` for prose: coordinated super-state, emergency
preemption with state preservation, adaptive green with queue cap, ped-walk
sub-FSM gated to AllRed, overflow carry across transitions.*

---

## Choreographic Case: Vault Intersection Simulator

[intersection-sim @config
    IN ORDER TO
        simulate a coordinated four-way intersection
        with adaptive timing based on detected queue
        pedestrian walk phases on request
        and emergency preemption that preserves then restores state

    @light <- [tl[new-intersection {config: @config}]]

    until @shutdown [
        at @every 100 ms
            [tl[tick {intersection: @light, ms: 100}]]
            #render
                ns-light: @light:ns-light
                ew-light: @light:ew-light
                ped-signal: @light:ped-signal
                elapsed-ms: @light:total-elapsed-ms

        sync @sensors {
            ns-queue @n -> [tl[set-ns-queue {intersection: @light, count: @n}]]
            ew-queue @n -> [tl[set-ew-queue {intersection: @light, count: @n}]]
        }

        sync @user {
            ped-button -> [tl[request-ped-crossing {intersection: @light}]]
        }

        sync @emergency {
            arriving -> [tl[begin-emergency {intersection: @light}]]
                        #alert "Emergency vehicle approaching"
            cleared  -> [tl[end-emergency {intersection: @light}]]
        }
    ]
]

---

## Verb Surface

[tl
    new-intersection       {config}
    tick                   {intersection, ms}
    set-ns-queue           {intersection, count}
    set-ew-queue           {intersection, count}
    request-ped-crossing   {intersection}
    begin-emergency        {intersection}
    end-emergency          {intersection}
    ns-light               {intersection}
    ew-light               {intersection}
    ped-signal             {intersection}
]

---

## Distinctive Innate idiom: phase as single coordinated super-state

The v1 wrote the impossibility invariant into the enum: only one
`Phase` value exists at a time, so "both green" is unrepresentable.
In Innate, the same invariant is naturally carried by the resolver:

[tl[tick {intersection: @light, ms: 100}]
    where
        at most one direction has green at any instant
        and the phase transitions cycle
            NS_GREEN → NS_YELLOW → ALL_RED → EW_GREEN → EW_YELLOW → ALL_RED → NS_GREEN
        and emergency preemption is a separate absorbing phase
            that saves (phase, elapsed, cycle-side) for restoration
]

The user doesn't construct a `Phase` value; they query
`@light:ns-light` and `@light:ew-light`, which the resolver computes
from the internal phase.

---

## Adaptive green extension as constraint not method

[tl[tick {intersection: @light, ms: 100}
    where
        when a green phase reaches its nominal duration
        and a queue is detected in that direction
        the green is extended by min(queue × 2000ms, remaining cap)
        where cap is @config:max-green-extension-ms minus already-extended
    so the extension decision happens once at phase-end, not per tick
]

---

## Demo

[demo
    @cfg <- {ns-green-ms: 1000, ns-yellow-ms: 200,
              ew-green-ms: 1000, ew-yellow-ms: 200,
              all-red-ms: 100, max-green-extension-ms: 500,
              ped-walk-ms: 500, ped-flashing-ms: 300}
    @i <- [tl[new-intersection {config: @cfg}]]

    -> @i:ns-light, @i:ew-light   ;; -> "green", "red"

    [tl[tick {intersection: @i, ms: 1000}]]
    -> @i:ns-light, @i:ew-light   ;; -> "yellow", "red"

    [tl[tick {intersection: @i, ms: 200}]]
    -> @i:ns-light, @i:ew-light   ;; -> "red", "red"   (all-red)

    [tl[tick {intersection: @i, ms: 100}]]
    -> @i:ns-light, @i:ew-light   ;; -> "red", "green"

    [tl[begin-emergency {intersection: @i}]]
    [tl[tick {intersection: @i, ms: 10000}]]
    -> @i:ns-light, @i:ew-light   ;; -> "red", "red"   (frozen at emergency)

    [tl[end-emergency {intersection: @i}]]
    -> @i:ew-light                 ;; -> "green" (restored to pre-emergency state)
]
